    "enUS": {
      "description": "It wouldn't be the first time those snakes bothered us. They need to be taught that their presence is not tolerated here.\r\n\r\nFind where their scouts are setting up camp and slaughter them. Bring me back their fins as proof. We need to act fast to make sure they understand.",
      "summary": "Collect 9 Naga Spinefins.",
      "title": "Threat from Below",
